  "description": "Rookie angel Arin is tasked with living among humans to grant the wishes of pure-hearted souls. One day, during an exhausting commute to work, a young man rescues her from oncoming traffic. To Arin’s surprise, her savior Tae-Yoon is one of the most pure-hearted humans she’s ever met, and his only desire is to escape his chronic nightmares. Following unconventional advice from a succubus friend, Arin enters his dreams to trade terror for ecstasy. But when Tae-Yoon recognizes his divine savior in the waking world, their nighttime cure blurs into an insatiable, real-life passion neither can resist.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note:\n\\- Part of Jaedam Media's Yeonhanam Danpyeonseon (연하남 단편선) Collection.\n\\- Includes one extra chapter.*",
